  "prefLabel": "He-W 552.11 Third Party Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 552.11 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #10676, eff 9-26-14 (from He-W 552.06)",
